using System;

namespace AdvancedGeology.WorldGen.ProceduralDeposits;

/// <summary>
/// Pyrochlore, monazite, bastnasite, xenotime, zircon, fluorite, quartz, feldspar, and sodalite occupy pegmatite sheets and fracture halos beneath an uplifted peralkaline pluton roof.
/// </summary>
